{"blocks": [{"type": "paragraph", "text": "こんばんは"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ゆーづです"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "先日はリアルミーグリありがとうございました"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "幕張"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202605/mobpisyh7.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202605/mobfCGjGd.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202605/mobCeKPbW.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202605/mobCxv8pU.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202605/mobDwuhdJ.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202605/mobau9Xdm.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202605/mobXKNow1.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202605/mobRHkoD2.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202605/mobbRTygh.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "とってもキュートなお洋服を着ました🎀"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ピンクピンクのサイリウムをいつも振ってくれている皆さんが、ピンクゆーづをいっぱい褒めてくださって嬉しかったです♪"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "またかわいい服着るね^_^"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "京都"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202605/mobXc3xhk.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202605/mobLQegXZ.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202605/mobBoklci.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202605/mob6BWuu6.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202605/mobeBlGw6.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "大好きな春がきたので春らしいお洋服にしました☘️"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "お姉さんですねと褒めてくださった方が多くて嬉しかっです⭐︎"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "カメラで撮ってもらったよー"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202605/mobZin9kB.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202605/mob1ySlOi.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "心のこもったお花も大切に眺めました💐"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ありがとうございます"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "皆さんとお話ししている時が1番素直な自分になれているんじゃないかなぁと"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "今シングルのミーグリはそう思うことが多かったです"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "皆さんといると素敵な自分になれる気がするというか。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "すごく楽しく、幸せな時間を過ごせていて、皆さんとの関係性が今とっても自慢です ふふ"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "いつも優しくしてくれてありがとう"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "まだまだ伝え足りないからゆーづ推しのみんなへまたトーク送ります"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "今月末のオンラインミーグリも！楽しみに待ってます😊"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ありがとうのブログでした"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "あなたが明日をニコニコで過ごせますように🌻"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "がんばろうね！応援してます"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "またね"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "おやすみ"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ゆーづより"}], "source": "official"}